  "descriptionHtml": "<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong><span><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0375/0107/5595/files/65l6jv_480x480.gif?v=1645132318\"></span></strong></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>Personalized kit of Bricks mosaic.</strong></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\">SIZE: 20x20 inches<br>BASE PLATES: 4 white clear<br>PIECES: 4,096<br>BUILDING TIME: 4H</div>\n<br>\n</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<p>Turn your favorite photo into a custom MemoBrick mosaic—designed by you!</p>\n<p>Upload your picture to our new web editor and watch it transform into brick art instantly. Adjust the colors, fine-tune the details, preview different sizes, and see exactly how your finished MemoBrick will look before ordering.</p>\n<p>Your kit includes all the 1×1 bricks, baseplates, personalized building instructions, and tools needed to bring your memory to life. Prefer some help? Let our designers create it for you and receive a free proof before production.</p>\n<p>Create it. Build it. Keep the memory forever.</p>\n</div>",
